<title>FRANCE: French stocks slip on poll rumour.</title>
<headline>French stocks slip on poll rumour.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>French shares fell and gave up earlier gains on a rumour about an IPSOS poll showing the centre-right would only get a tiny majority in the parliamentary election. An IPSOS poll is due out at 1630 GMT.</p>
<p>The blue-chip CAC-40 index was down 2.39 points or 0.09 percent at 2,531.25 at 1438 GMT while the CAC-40 futures contract was down five at 2,530.</p>
